ytán túlélnénk",params:[]),(code:20110,indent:0,string:"az ugrást, akkor biztos, hogy",params:[]),(code:20110,indent:0,string:"kezünk-lábunk törjük...\"",params:[]),(code:10110,indent:0,string:"Daren",params:[]),(code:20110,indent:0,string:"\"Ilyen magasról leugrani kész",params:[]),(code:20110,indent:0,string:"öngyilkosság.\"",params:[]),(code:10130,indent:0,string:"Stark",params:[1,0,0]),(code:10110,indent:0,string:"Stark",params:[]),(code:20110,indent:0,string:"\"De nem ejtőernyővel. Mielőtt",params:[]),(code:20110,indent:0,string:"feljöttünk a pilótafülkébe, magamhoz",params:[]),(code:20110,indent:0,string:"vettem párat.\"",params:[]),(code:10130,indent:0,string:"Daren",params:[0,0,0]),(code:10110,indent:0,string:"Daren",params:[]),(code:20110,indent:0,string:"\"Mi az az ejtőernyő?\"",params:[]),(code:10130,indent:0,string:"Stark",params:[1,0,0]),(code:10110,indent:0,string:"Stark",params:[]),(code:20110,indent:0,string:"\"Most nincs idő elmagyarázni,",params:[]),(code:20110,indent:0,string:"hogy hogyan épül fel, a lényeg az,",params:[]),(code:20110,indent:0,string:"hogy lassítja a zuhanást.",params:[]),(code:10110,indent:0,string:"Stark",params:[]),(code:20110,indent:0,string:"\"Fogjátok, vegyétek fel a hátatokra,",params:[]),(code:20110,indent:0,string:"és ugrás után húzzátok meg ezt a",params:[]),(code:20110,indent:0,string:"zsinórt!\"",params:[]),(code:10130,indent:0,string:"Alen",params:[0,0,0]),(code:10110,indent:0,string:"Alen",params:[]),(code:20110,indent:0,string:"\"Honnan szereztél te ilyen",params:[]),(code:20110,indent:0,string:"cuccokat?\"",params:[]),(code:10130,indent:0,string:"Stark",params:[1,0,0]),(code:10110,indent:0,string:"Stark",params:[]),(code:20110,indent:0,string:"\"Amikor a léghajót megtaláltuk,",params:[]),(code:20110,indent:0,string:"akkor ezek is benne voltak.\"",params:[]),(code:10130,indent:0,string:"Alen",params:[0,0,0]),(code:10110,indent:0,string:"Alen",params:[]),(code:20110,indent:0,string:"\"Aha.\"",params:[]),(code:10130,indent:0,string:"Alen",params:[1,0,0]),(code:10110,indent:0,string:"Alen",params:[]),(code:20110,indent:0,string:"\"Na jó, kéz és lábtörést mindenkinek!",params:[]),(code:20110,indent:0,string:"Odalent találkozunk!\"",params:[]),(code:11330,indent:0,string:"",params:[5,8,0,0,5,28,26,24,0,2,2,28,5,5,5,5,25,34,5,84,111,114,99,104,1]),(code:11330,indent:0,string:"",params:[4,8,0,0,14]),(code:11330,indent:0,string:"",params:[6,8,0,0,14]),(code:10130,indent:0,string:"Ron",params:[5,0,0]),(code:10110,indent:0,string:"\\N[1]",params:[]),(code:20110,indent:0,string:"\"Alen!!!\"",params:[]),(code:10130,indent:0,string:"Stark",params:[1,0,0]),(code:10110,indent:0,string:"Stark",params:[]),(code:20110,indent:0,string:"\"Huhh... Hát nem semmi ez a fickó...\"",params:[]),(code:11330,indent:0,string:"",params:[6,8,0,0,12]),(code:11330,indent:0,string:"",params:[4,8,0,0,12]),(code:11410,indent:0,string:"",params:[1]),(code:10110,indent:0,string:"Stark",params:[]),(code:20110,indent:0,string:"\"Egyre közeledik a talaj, úgyhogy",params:[]),(code:20110,indent:0,string:"siessünk! Sok szerencsét!\"",params:[]),(code:11330,indent:0,string:"",params:[6,8,0,0,28,26,24,0,2,2,28,5,5,5,5,25,34,5,84,111,114,99,104,1]),(code:11330,indent:0,string:"",params:[5,8,0,0,14]),(code:11410,indent:0,string:"",params:[5]),(code:11330,indent:0,string:"",params:[5,8,0,0,12]),(code:11410,indent:0,string:"",params:[1]),(code:10130,indent:0,string:"Daren",params:[0,0,0]),(code:10110,indent:0,string:"Daren",params:[]),(code:20110,indent:0,string:"\"Gyertek!\"",params:[]),(code:11330,indent:0,string:"",params:[4,8,0,0,14,28,26,24,0,2,2,28,5,5,5,5,25,34,5,84,111,114,99,104,1]),(code:11410,indent:0,string:"",params:[20]),(code:11330,indent:0,string:"",params:[3,8,0,0,13]),(code:11330,indent:0,string:"",params:[10005,8,0,0,15]),(code:11410,indent:0,string:"",params:[1]),(code:10130,indent:0,string:"Tiffany",params:[5,0,0]),(code:10110,indent:0,string:"Tiffany",params:[]),(code:20110,indent:0,string:"\"\\N[1]... Én... Én nem merek",params:[]),(code:20110,indent:0,string:"leugrani...\"",params:[]),(code:10130,indent:0,string:"Ron",params:[6,0,0]),(code:10110,indent:0,string:"\\N[1]",params:[]),(code:20110,indent:0,string:"\"Ez az egyetlen esélyünk. Meg",params:[]),(code:20110,indent:0,string:"Stark is mondta, hogy ez az",params:[]),(code:20110,indent:0,string:"ejtőernyő lassítja a zuhanást.\"",params:[]),(code:10130,indent:0,string:"Tiffany",params:[4,0,0]),(code:10110,indent:0,string:"Tiffany",params:[]),(code:20110,indent:0,string:"\"...\"",params:[]),(code:10130,indent:0,string:"Ron",params:[7,0,0]),(code:10110,indent:0,string:"\\N[1]",params:[]),(code:20110,indent:0,string:"\"Gyere, észre se fogod venni, és",params:[]),(code:20110,indent:0,string:"máris lent leszünk...\"",params:[]),(code:10130,indent:0,string:"Tiffany",params:[4,0,0]),(code:10110,indent:0,string:"Tiffany",params:[]),(code:20110,indent:0,string:"\"Jó...\"",params:[]),(code:11330,indent:0,string:"",params:[10005,8,0,0,2]),(code:11330,indent:0,string:"",params:[3,8,0,0,2]),(code:11410,indent:0,string:"",params:[10]),(code:12010,indent:0,string:"",params:[1,1,0,8,1,1]),(code:10130,indent:1,string:"Tiffany",params:[4,0,0]),(code:10110,indent:1,string:"Tiffany",params:[]),(code:20110,indent:1,string:"\"\\N[1]... Fogd a kezem, amíg le nem",params:[]),(code:20110,indent:1,string:"érünk... Kérlek...\"",params:[]),(code:11410,indent:1,string:"",params:[5]),(code:11520,indent:1,string:"",params:[4000]),(code:11330,indent:1,string:"",params:[10005,8,0,0,28,26,24,0,2,2,28,5,5,5,5,25,34,5,84,111,114,99,104,1]),(code:11330,indent:1,string:"",params:[3,8,0,0,28,26,24,0,2,2,28,5,5,5,5,25,34,5,84,111,114,99,104,1]),(code:10,indent:1,string:"",params:[]),(code:22010,indent:0,string:"",params:[]),(code:11520,indent:1,string:"",params:[4000]),(code:11330,indent:1,string:"",params:[10005,8,0,0,28,26,24,0,2,2,28,5,5,5,5,25,34,5,84,111,114,99,104,1]),(code:11330,indent:1,string:"",params:[3,8,0,0,28,26,24,0,2,2,28,5,5,5,5,25,34,